<c>is </c><00:00:02.828><c>a  </c><00:00:02.832><c>finite </c><00:00:02.836><c>number </c><00:00:02.840><c>so </c><00:00:02.844><c>this </c><00:00:02.848><c>is </c><00:00:02.852><c>taken </c><00:00:02.856><c>for  </c><00:00:02.860><c>granted </c><00:00:02.864><c>in </c><00:00:02.868><c>order </c><00:00:02.872><c>to </c><00:00:02.876><c>carry </c><00:00:02.880><c>out </c><00:00:02.884><c>this  </c><00:00:02.888><c>derivation </c><00:00:02.892><c>this </c><00:00:02.896><c>is </c><00:00:02.900><c>to </c><00:00:02.904><c>be </c><00:00:02.908><c>contrasted </c><00:00:02.912><c>with  </c><00:00:02.916><c>the </c><00:00:02.920><c>first </c><00:00:02.924><c>derivation </c><00:00:02.928><c>in </c><00:00:02.932><c>which </c><00:00:02.936><c>we </c><00:00:02.940><c>didn't  </c><00:00:02.944><c>have </c><00:00:02.948><c>to </c><00:00:02.952><c>make </c><00:00:02.956><c>any </c><00:00:02.960><c>such </c><00:00:02.964><c>assumption </c><00:00:02.968><c>so  </c><00:00:02.972><c>strictly </c><00:00:02.976><c>speaking </c><00:00:02.980><c>for </c><00:00:02.984><c>this </c><00:00:02.988><c>derivation  </c><00:00:02.992><c>here </c><00:00:02.996><c>to </c><00:00:03.000><c>be </c><00:00:03.004><c>correct </c><00:00:03.008><c>we </c><00:00:03.012><c>need </c><00:00:03.016><c>to </c><00:00:03.020><c>have </c><00:00:03.024><c>some  </c><00:00:03.028><c>independent </c><00:00:03.032><c>way </c><00:00:03.036><c>of </c><00:00:03.040><c>verifying </c><00:00:03.044><c>that </c><00:00:03.048><c>s </c><00:00:03.052><c>is  </c><00:00:03.056><c>less </c><00:00:03.060><c>than </c><00:00:03.064><c>infinity </c><00:00:03.068><c>but </c><00:00:03.072><c>other </c><00:00:03.076><c>than </c><00:00:03.080><c>that  </c><00:00:03.084><c>it's </c><00:00:03.088><c>an </c><00:00:03.092><c>interesting </c><00:00:03.096><c>algebraic </c><00:00:03.100><c>trick</c>

